      "created_at": "2013-12-24T11:05:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Got bored waiting for Christmas and compiled a spreadsheet of which cards reference which issues in the Sentinels comics verse.</p><p>This pulled out the following facts:</p><p>Hero with fewest different appearances in their deck: Bunker with 10</p><p>Hero with most different appearances in their deck: The Argent Adept with 17</p><p>Villain with fewest different appearances in their deck: The Matriarch with a mere 5</p><p>Villain with most different appearances in their deck: The Chairman with 13</p><p>Issue with the most appearances in a single deck: La Capitan's La Paradoja Magnifica one-shot.</p><p>Issue with the appearances in the most decks: Science and Progress One Shot appearing in 8 different decks. After Vengeance decks are included, Vengeance #4 dethrones this crossover juggernaut with appearances in 9 decks (but only 1 pre-Vengeance).</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:53.490Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
