      "created_at": "2013-12-24T22:19:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>At the very end of the process, we get the proofs to make sure there's no misprints. I personally spend as much on printer ink as I do on the game (excluding shipping) to get good quality colour versions early as it's more fun than with a black on white card. And yes, they were my cards used at the London gathering. Playing Vengeance characters with Christopher was a heck of a lot of fun.</p>",
