      "created_at": "2013-12-24T22:31:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As a creation goddess, Akash has no reason to speak, she makes things that do what she wishes, and can probably control them as well. &nbsp;She would have no reason to form language or learn to communicate with things that she destroys and creates at will.</p><p>The only god's that should use language are those that desire worship or obedience of creatures that they respect. &nbsp;Akash shows no sign of desiring worship or respecting individuality.</p>",
