      "id": 85385,
      "name": "lynkfox",
      "username": "lynkfox",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-25T05:06:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Has Vengeance been released without my noticing?&nbsp; People are acting as if they've seen the cards, flavor text and all (and the Statistics Project has been updated, so perhaps people are playing with them too).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>nah, i just know my time will be short again soon enough, so figured id get it out of the way now before too long, also give Arathorn some time to work on getting his sheets to parse the data.&nbsp;</p>",
